# Planted bugs for the confirmed design. Each one must make its property fail.
run fv-tlc SagaOrchestrated.tla ConfirmedCompensate.cfg WitnessSkipCompensation.cfg
properties CompensateImpliesRan SettledEffectIsFinal EventuallyDone
file SagaOrchestrated.tla

mutation confirm-and-settle compensates without checking whether the effect landed
detects CompensateImpliesRan
-     /\ compensated' = effectB
+     /\ compensated' = TRUE

mutation confirm-and-settle decides without fencing the step first
detects SettledEffectIsFinal
-     /\ fenced' = TRUE
+     /\ fenced' = FALSE

mutation a saga that times out can never reach an end state
detects EventuallyDone
-     /\ pc' = "timed_out"
+     /\ pc' = "b_inflight"

harmless a comment on the fencing step
- \* the step before deciding, so no later attempt can still land.
+ \* the step before deciding, so no later attempt lands.
